\newlabel{fig:denoise}{{3}{4}{\textbf {Denoising Teacher Representations with Augmentations.} For each model, we visualize the UMAP of dense features before and after applying test-time augmentation. The results show that our proposed method produces noticeably cleaner dense feature representations without requiring gradient-based learning. Please zoom in for details}{figure.caption.7}{}}
